{"id":"u-4678d3e6-1212-4f4f-b3f6-166daa5d3743","src":"community","title":"Shonen Fit: Awakening Arc","author":"Kaleb F.","url":"https://www.boostcamp.app/users/f2dJIc-shonen-fit-awakening-arc","desc":"Shonen Fit was designed to help anyone wanting to look like an Anime main character, regardless of where they are in their fitness journey.  It can be used whether you are bulking, cutting, recomping, or even maintaining.  It is also repeatable and doesn't require any set deload weeks.  Just take it easy on days where you're not 100% and you should be set.  So, if you want to look like the hero of your story give this a try.  You won't regret it!\n\nAnime-inspired transformation training\nUpper/Lower split\nBeginner/intermediate friendly\nSustainable progression\nRecoverable volume\nAesthetic physique development\n\nCardio Protocols\nThis program is designed to work whether your goal is:\nfat loss\nmuscle gain\nrecomp\nmaintenance\nAdjust cardio volume based on your current goal and recovery.\nCUTTING PHASE\nRecommended: 3–5 cardio sessions weekly\nSuggested duration: 15–30 minutes per session\nRecommended styles:\nincline treadmill walk\nstairmaster\nstationary bike\nlight jogging\nGoal: Increase calorie expenditure while maintaining recovery and lifting performance.\nAvoid excessive cardio that negatively impacts recovery or gym performance.\nRECOMP PHASE\nRecommended: 2–4 cardio sessions weekly\nSuggested duration: 10–25 minutes per session\nGoal: Support conditioning, recovery, and body composition improvements while building muscle and losing fat gradually.\nLEAN BULKING PHASE\nRecommended: 1–3 cardio sessions weekly\nSuggested duration: 10–20 minutes per session\nGoal: Maintain conditioning, cardiovascular health, recovery, and work capacity while minimizing unnecessary fatigue.\nMAINTENANCE PHASE\nRecommended: 2–3 cardio sessions weekly\nSuggested duration: 10–20 minutes per session\nGoal: Maintain conditioning, recovery, and overall athleticism.\n\nFor the supersets, you don't have to do them as supersets.  You can do one movement at a time if you'd like.\n\nThe plan is meant to be ran from Monday to Friday.  If you happen to miss a day, it's perfectly fine to push everything a day back for that week as long as you get all the workouts done.\n\nIf you'd like to know more about me visit www.youtube.com/@Kaelus_Physique","level":["Beginner","Novice","Intermediate","Advanced"],"goals":["Athletics","Muscle","Bodyweight Fitness"],"equipment":["Full Gym"],"minutes":60,"joins":4,"rate":0,"rateCount":0,"updated":"2026-06-10T13:06:31.830Z","variations":[{"name":"default","days":["Hero Upper (Goku Approved)","Hero Lower (Titan Form)","Foundation (Nah, I'd Win)","Ascension Upper (Wizard King)","Ascension Lower (Rank: Hokage)"],"weeks":[[{"ex":[{"n":"Bench Press (Dumbbell)","sets":[{"lo":8,"hi":12,"rpe":8,"x":4}]},{"n":"Lat Pulldown","sets":[{"lo":8,"hi":12,"rpe":8,"x":4}]},{"n":"Pec Deck (Machine)","sets":[{"lo":10,"hi":15,"rpe":9,"x":3}]},{"n":"Lateral Raise (Dumbbell)","sets":[{"lo":12,"hi":15,"rpe":9,"x":3}]},{"ss":[{"n":"Bicep Curl (Cable)","sets":[{"lo":10,"hi":15,"rpe":9,"x":3}]},{"n":"Reverse Curl (Cable)","sets":[{"lo":10,"hi":15,"rpe":9,"x":3}]}]},{"n":"Elevated Close-Grip Push-Up","sets":[{"amrap":1,"rpe":10,"x":2}]}]},{"ex":[{"n":"Hack Squat","sets":[{"lo":8,"hi":12,"rpe":8,"x":4}]},{"n":"Romanian Deadlift (Smith Machine)","sets":[{"lo":8,"hi":12,"rpe":8,"x":4}]},{"n":"Leg Extension","sets":[{"lo":10,"hi":15,"rpe":9,"x":3}]},{"n":"Hamstring Biased Leg Press","sets":[{"lo":10,"hi":15,"rpe":9,"x":3}]},{"n":"Standing Calf Raise","sets":[{"lo":12,"hi":15,"rpe":10,"x":3}]}]},{"ex":[{"n":"Box Jump","sets":[{"sec":60,"rpe":8,"x":4}]},{"ss":[{"n":"Med Ball Slam","sets":[{"sec":60,"rpe":8,"x":3}]},{"n":"Treadmill Sprints","sets":[{"sec":60,"rpe":8,"x":3}]}]},{"n":"Cable Crunch","sets":[{"lo":12,"hi":15,"rpe":9,"x":4}]},{"n":"Kelso Shrug (Chest Supported)","sets":[{"amrap":1,"rpe":10,"x":2}]}]},{"ex":[{"n":"Incline Chest Press (Mac